###Error
Can't find property 'name' in class 'Any' (at valueSpecification/functionExpression/dot/property_E_unknownPropertyOnAnyInLambda:34c37-34c41)

###Pure
import platform::pure::metamodel::type::*;

function test::anyValues():Any[*]
{
    [];
}

// Regression: when an unresolved property access on an Any[1]-typed lambda
// parameter is followed by a downstream `cast(@T)` (or any other dispatch
// over multiple candidates that re-resolves the lambda body), the error
// must still be surfaced. Earlier the candidate-trial rollback dropped the
// `Can't find property` error and the unresolved FunctionExpression reached
// the PDB writer, which crashed with `null _func()`.
function test::tst():String[*]
{
    test::anyValues()->filter(v | $v.name == 'RED')->cast(@String);
}

